  "content": {
    "title": "It's Good Friday. What are grocery store hours in Indiana?",
    "text": "April 3, 2026, 8:46 a.m. ETMany grocery stores are closed on Easter Sunday and some have reduced hours on Good Friday.But those in need of last-minute goods need not fret, many stores in the Indianapolis area will be open on this holiday to accommodate.What grocery stores are open on Good Friday, Easter Sunday 2026?Here are the shopping hours for Indianapolis-area grocery stores on Good Friday and Easter Day 2026.AldiGood Friday: Regular hoursEaster Sunday: CLOSEDBJ’s Wholesale ClubGood Friday: 8 a.m. - 9 p.m.Easter Sunday: 8 a.m. - 7 p.m. Cleo’s BodegaGood Friday: 8 a.m. - 5 p.m.Easter Sunday: CLOSEDCostcoGood Friday: 10 a.m. - 8:30 p.m.Easter Sunday: CLOSEDThe Fresh MarketGood Friday: 8 a.m. - 9 p.m.Easter Sunday: 8 a.m. - 6 p.m. Fresh ThymeGood Friday: 7 a.m. - 9 p.m. (Indianapolis and Fishers stores open until 10 p.m.)Easter Sunday: 7 a.m. - 9 p.m. (Indianapolis and Fishers stores open until 10 p.m.)KrogerGood Friday: Regular hoursEaster Sunday: Regular hoursMarket DistrictGood Friday: 6 a.m. - 10 p.m.Easter Sunday: 6 a.m. - 4 p.m. Pharmacy is closed.Order groceries with InstacartMeijer Good Friday: 6 a.m. - midnightEaster Sunday: 6 a.m. - midnightNeedler’s Fresh MarketGood Friday: Regular hoursEaster Sunday: Regular hoursSafewayGood Friday: 7 a.m. to 10 p.m. Easter Sunday: 7 a.m. to 10 p.m.Sam’s ClubGood Friday: 8 a.m. - 8 p.m.Easter Sunday: CLOSEDSaraga International GroceryGood Friday: 8 a.m. - 9 p.m.Easter Sunday: 8 a.m. - 9 p.m.TargetGood Friday: 8 a.m. - 10 p.m.Easter Sunday: CLOSEDTrader Joe’sGood Friday: 9 a.m. - 9 p.m.Easter Sunday: 9 a.m. - 5 p.m. WalmartGood Friday: 6 a.m. - 11 p.m.Easter Sunday: 6 a.m. - 11 p.m.Whole FoodsGood Friday: 8 a.m. - 10 p.m.Easter Sunday: 8 a.m. - 6 p.m. Contact reporter Cheryl V. Jackson at cheryl.jackson@indystar.com or 317-444-6264. Follow her on X.com:@cherylvjackson or Bluesky:@cherylvjackson.bsky.social.Our team of savvy editors independently handpicks all recommendations. If you purchase through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices were accurate at the time of publication but may change.",
